OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FThe east
OL,6,Fwill be dry with some clear spells
OL,7,Fthis evening. Cloud and rain will
OL,8,Fspread to western areas, turning
OL,9,Fheavier and then extending to the east
OL,10,Fovernight.
OL,11,
OL,12,CWednesday:FA cloudy start with
OL,13,Foutbreaks of rain, but soon
OL,14,Fbrightening up in the west with sunny
OL,15,Fintervals and the odd shower, these
OL,16,Fbrighter conditions reaching the east
OL,17,Fin the afternoon.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
