OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:
OL,6,FThursday bright with sunny spells and
OL,7,Fthe odd shower. Heavy rain on Thursday
OL,8,Fnight clearing during Friday, windy.
OL,9,FBright with some showers on Saturday.
